### Request collection for the VS Code "REST Client" / IntelliJ HTTP client.
### Start the stack first:  docker compose up --build
@host = http://localhost:8088
@api = {{host}}/api/v1

### 1. Login as a regular user (demo profile)
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@company.local", "password": "Password123!" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Who am I
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change password: returns a NEW token (every older token is revoked)
POST {{api}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "Password123!", "newPassword": "NewPassword123!" }

### Booking rules the UI uses
GET {{api}}/config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List rooms (filters: minCapacity, equipment, page, size, sort)
GET {{api}}/rooms?minCapacity=8&equipment=projector&sort=capacity,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Day schedule for all rooms (company time zone date)
GET {{api}}/schedule?date=2030-01-15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Schedule of one room (replace the id) - either ?date= or ?from=&to=
GET {{api}}/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/schedule?date=2030-01-15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Find rooms free for a window (%2B is an encoded "+"; a trailing Z also works)
GET {{api}}/rooms/available?start=2030-01-15T10:00:00%2B07:00&end=2030-01-15T11:00:00%2B07:00&minCapacity=6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Free gaps in a room for a day
GET {{api}}/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/free-slots?date=2030-01-15&minDuration=60
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a booking (409 BOOKING_CONFLICT if the slot is taken, 422 for rule violations)
POST {{api}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "title": "Planning",
  "description": "Quarterly planning",
  "attendees": 6,
  "private": true,
  "startTime": "2030-01-15T10:00:00+07:00",
  "endTime": "2030-01-15T11:00:00+07:00"
}
# "private": true -> other employees only see that the room is busy (title "Private", no booker/description)

### Recurring booking: WEEKLY | BIWEEKLY | WEEKDAYS, 2..26 occurrences, onConflict FAIL (default) | SKIP
POST {{api}}/bookings/series
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "title": "Weekly sync",
  "attendees": 6,
  "startTime": "2030-01-15T10:00:00+07:00",
  "endTime": "2030-01-15T11:00:00+07:00",
  "frequency": "WEEKLY",
  "occurrences": 4,
  "onConflict": "SKIP"
}

### Cancel this and all following occurrences of a series
POST {{api}}/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel-series
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "project finished" }

### Move a booking to another room (send a different roomId)
PUT {{api}}/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "title": "Planning",
  "attendees": 6,
  "startTime": "2030-01-15T10:00:00+07:00",
  "endTime": "2030-01-15T11:00:00+07:00"
}

### My bookings (status, from, to, endedBefore, page, size, sort)
GET {{api}}/bookings/my?status=CONFIRMED&sort=startTime,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel a booking
POST {{api}}/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "plans changed" }

### ---------------- admin ----------------
# @name adminLogin
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@company.local", "password": "Admin12345!" }

###
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Create a room
POST {{api}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Phoenix", "location": "Floor 5", "capacity": 12, "equipment": ["projector", "whiteboard"] }

### Block a room (maintenance). 409 BLOCK_CONFLICTS_WITH_BOOKINGS lists the clashing bookings;
### set cancelConflicting=true to cancel them and block anyway
POST {{api}}/admin/blocks
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "startTime": "2030-01-15T09:00:00+07:00",
  "endTime": "2030-01-15T12:00:00+07:00",
  "reason": "Projector repair",
  "cancelConflicting": false
}

### Upcoming blocks
GET {{api}}/bookings?kind=BLOCK&status=CONFIRMED
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### All bookings of the company
GET {{api}}/bookings?status=CONFIRMED&size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create a user
POST {{api}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "new.hire@company.local", "fullName": "New Hire", "password": "Welcome12345!", "role": "USER" }
